    <item>
      <title>泰國旅遊要注意！當心誤入數位入境卡TDAC詐騙付費網站</title>
      <link>https://visionthai.net/article/thailand-tdac-scam-websites-10-percent-travelers-fooled/</link>
      <description>準備入境泰國要小心詐騙網站！ 泰國移民局(Immigration Bureau)警告外國旅客，詐騙網站假冒泰國數位入境卡(Thailand Digital Arrival Card, TDAC)官網收取費用，實際上官方註冊完全免費。移民局發言人指出，至少10%外國入境旅客誤用詐騙網站，被收取20至90美元(約680至3,000銖)不等費用，個資還可能遭盜用。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://visionthai.net/article/thailand-tdac-scam-websites-10-percent-travelers-fooled/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://visionthai.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/g260330_thailand-tdac-scam-websites-10-percent-travelers-fooled_tc_og.webp" length="0" type="image/webp"/>
      <pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 10:01:25 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
