    <item>
      <title>米其林餐廳帶動泰國觀光！74%旅客為「美食」而旅行 消費年增45%</title>
      <link>https://visionthai.net/article/thailand-michelin-guide-tourism-74-percent-travelers-consumption-up-45-percent/</link>
      <description>《泰國米其林指南》引領美食旅遊，研究顯示 4%國際旅客會因米其林餐廳選擇目的地，更有76%願為美食延長行程。這股風潮預計為泰國2025年帶來8.22億銖餐飲消費，年增達45%。指南推行8年來已創造31.82億銖增量消費，投報率高達14.7倍，成為吸引高價值旅客的關鍵。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://visionthai.net/article/thailand-michelin-guide-tourism-74-percent-travelers-consumption-up-45-percent/</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://visionthai.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/c260401_thailand-michelin-guide-tourism-74-percent-travelers-consumption-up-45-percent_og.webp" length="0" type="image/webp"/>
